==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{m|gmh|biutel}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|būtil}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈbɔʏ̯tl̩/|/ˈbɔʏ̯təl/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-Beutel.ogg|Audio|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|m||Beutel}}

# a small to medium-sized [[bag]], usually of fabric (sometimes also of paper or plastic, for which more properly {{m|de|Tüte}})
#: {{ux|de|Der '''Beutel''' ist ziemlich voll.|The bag is quite full.}}
# [[pouch]] {{gloss|bag with a [[drawstring]]}}
# [[pouch]] {{gloss|body part of a [[marsupial]]}}

